## Decisions Made

- **Single Scroll Layer on Drawers**: Prevents nested touch gesture fighting on mobile WebKit and Android Chrome.
- **RAF Scroll Listener Batching**: Prevents main thread lag and Change Detection thrashing during rapid mouse wheel and touch panning.
- **Dedicated Root Download Tray**: Allows downloads to persist across SPA route changes without blocking the user.

